  "content": "<h1>更多《我的世界》中的《我的世界》</h1><h1>新增超過6000種裝飾變體！</h1><h1>在鐵砧上重新命名物品，實現無限自訂！</h1><h1>新增內容不替換現有紋理！</h1><p><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://i.redd.it/s0q08ghzmtde1.png&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"\" width=\"5863\" height=\"5942\"></p><h1>但這還不是全部！</h1><h1>還有更多變體！而且我一直在持續增加！</h1><h1>查看我的資源包中裝飾變體的完整清單！</h1><h1><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1kSjHyrZ60fVfBGip9Ho6QbFmMZ1CCtDfqIQLVj4hFvM/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">資源包中所有已命名變體</a></span></h1><p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1kSjHyrZ60fVfBGip9Ho6QbFmMZ1CCtDfqIQLVj4hFvM/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">點擊連結查看此資源包新增的裝飾物品完整清單</span></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>資源包包含但不限於：</p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:640px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gZctspAFf_U?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&amp;index=1\" width=\"640\" height=\"377\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/OI9APvuQJK4?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1kSjHyrZ60fVfBGip9Ho6QbFmMZ1CCtDfqIQLVj4hFvM/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看我的資源包中已命名變體的完整清單！</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>重要公告：還有更多內容！<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1kSjHyrZ60fVfBGip9Ho6QbFmMZ1CCtDfqIQLVj4hFvM/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊這裡</a>查看此資源包中已命名變體的完整清單</strong></span></p><p>（截至目前，盔甲/鞘翅仍需要如OptiFine等模組支援）</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h2>此資源包還支援自訂火把！</h2><p>將鐵粒或石頭類物品重新命名為「Sconce」後，當放置在火把後方的物品展示框中時，會呈現出自訂火把的外觀！這段描述有點繞口……但這確實是非常酷的功能，且提供多種風格選擇！</p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FRA9wpf8ZFs\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tNi0zoMFhr4?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/CH9cAoiF0yc?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
